me": "100", "image": "engenn6le09ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Okay, but what do we actually know about them? What's your opinion of them?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: The way I see it, the Garcia Partners in Miami are probably our most likely competitor for this bid. They're the only company in America to have sales expertise in the Latin American market.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I've heard of them. They're an e-commerce company that provides sales services via a web portal.", "id": 2, "time": "26500", "image": "engenn6le09ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Youbuye.com! As far as I know, they provide not only consumer-to-consumer sales, but also business-to-consumer and business-to-business as well, which makes them more appealing these days.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. This means they have a clear advantage over us and they're already used to working with the Latin American market while we still have to get a foot in the door.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That is correct, but if you ask me, I still think we have more chances of winning this bid. Let me give you a rundown on Garcia so we can get a clearer picture of who we're dealing with.", "id": 3, "time": "48000", "image": "engenn6le09ob02re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le09ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}